{"id":"287ea7fe632b00c1","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom.md","title":"ZFC Forcing8 Forcing Axiom","display":"df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom — ZFC Forcing8 Forcing Axiom","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom — ZFC Forcing8 Forcing Axiom","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]","[[58-df-zfc-dense-open-family]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom — ZFC Forcing8 Forcing Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3bf4287c83498be0\" href=\"?note=3bf4287c83498be0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-dense-open-family\">58-df-zfc-dense-open-family</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ad1cb778dd1ba8fe\" href=\"?note=ad1cb778dd1ba8fe\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter\">58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\kappa,\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\mathcal D,G\\in V\">\\(\\Gamma,\\kappa,\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\mathcal D,G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span> (forcing-poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S\\)</span> (order-explicit dense-open-family predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3bf4287c83498be0\" href=\"?note=3bf4287c83498be0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-dense-open-family\">58-df-zfc-dense-open-family</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S\\)</span> (order-explicit dense-set-meeting filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ad1cb778dd1ba8fe\" href=\"?note=ad1cb778dd1ba8fe\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter\">58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}axiom} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\mathbb P\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists P,\\leq_P,1_P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P,1_P\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\land\\forall\\mathcal D\\;\\bigl((\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S(\\mathcal D,P,\\leq_P)\\land|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\kappa)\\to\\exists G\\;\\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S(G,\\mathcal D,P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}axiom} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\mathbb P\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists P,\\leq_P,1_P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P,1_P\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\land\\forall\\mathcal D\\;\\bigl((\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S(\\mathcal D,P,\\leq_P)\\land|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\kappa)\\to\\exists G\\;\\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S(G,\\mathcal D,P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> is a set of coded forcing notions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle P,\\leq_P,1_P\\rangle\">\\(\\langle P,\\leq_P,1_P\\rangle\\)</span>; every family of at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> dense open sets is met by one filter.</li>\n<li>The dense-family and meeting-filter clauses share the order and greatest condition encoded by the same member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-dense-open-family","status":"resolved","id":"3bf4287c83498be0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-dense-open-family]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter","status":"resolved","id":"ad1cb778dd1ba8fe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFor